#. type: TH
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "LOCATE"
msgstr "LOCATE"

#. type: SH
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "名称"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:4
msgid "locate - list files in databases that match a pattern"
msgstr "locate - 列出数据库中与模式匹配的文件"

#. type: SH
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "概述"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:24
msgid ""
"B<locate> [-d path | --database=path] [-e | -E | --[non-]existing] [-i | "
"--ignore-case] [-0 | --null] [-c | --count] [-w | --wholename] [-b | "
"--basename] [-l N | --limit=N] [-S | --statistics] [-r | --regex ] "
"[--max-database-age D] [-P | -H | --nofollow] [-L | --follow] [--version]"
" [-A | --all] [-p | --print] [--help] pattern..."
msgstr ""
"B<locate> [-d 路径 | --database=路径] [-e | -E | --[non-]existing] [-i | "
"--ignore-case] [-0 | --null] [-c | --count] [-w | --wholename] [-b | "
"--basename] [-l N | --limit=N] [-S | --statistics] [-r | --regex ] "
"[--max-database-age D] [-P | -H | --nofollow] [-L | --follow] [--version]"
" [-A | --all] [-p | --print] [--help] 模式..."

#. type: SH
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "描述"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:38
msgid ""
"This manual page documents the GNU version of B<locate>.  For each given "
"pattern, B<locate> searches one or more databases of file names and "
"displays the file names that contain the pattern.  Patterns can contain "
"shell-style metacharacters: `*', `?', and `[]'.  The metacharacters do "
"not treat `/' or `.' specially.  Therefore, a pattern `foo*bar' can match"
" a file name that contains `foo3/bar', and a pattern `*duck*' can match a"
" file name that contains `lake/.ducky'.  Patterns that contain "
"metacharacters should be quoted to protect them from expansion by the "
"shell."
msgstr ""
"本手册页介绍 GNU 版本的 B<locate>。对于每个给定的模式，B<locate> "
"会搜索一个或多个文件名数据库，并显示包含该模式的文件名。模式可以包含 shell 风格元字符：`*'、`?' 和 `[]'。这些元字符不会对 "
"`/' 或 `.' 做特殊处理。因此，模式 `foo*bar' 可以匹配包含 `foo3/bar' 的文件名，模式 `*duck*' 可以匹配包含"
" `lake/.ducky' 的文件名。包含元字符的模式应加引号，以防止被 shell 展开。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:49
msgid ""
"If a pattern is a plain string \\(em it contains no metacharacters \\(em "
"B<locate> displays all file names in the database that contain that "
"string anywhere.  If a pattern does contain metacharacters, B<locate> "
"only displays file names that match the pattern exactly.  As a result, "
"patterns that contain metacharacters should usually begin with a `*', and"
" will most often end with one as well.  The exceptions are patterns that "
"are intended to explicitly match the beginning or end of a file name."
msgstr ""
"如果模式是普通字符串——不包含元字符——B<locate> "
"会显示数据库中任意位置包含该字符串的所有文件名。如果模式确实包含元字符，B<locate> "
"只显示与模式完全匹配的文件名。因此，包含元字符的模式通常应以 `*' 开头，并且通常也以 `*' "
"结尾。例外情况是打算显式匹配文件名开头或结尾的模式。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:55
msgid ""
"The file name databases contain lists of files that were on the system "
"when the databases were last updated.  The system administrator can "
"choose the file name of the default database, the frequency with which "
"the databases are updated, and the directories for which they contain "
"entries; see B<updatedb>(1)."
msgstr ""
"文件名数据库包含数据库上次更新时系统上存在的文件列表。系统管理员可以选择默认数据库的文件名、数据库更新的频率，以及数据库包含条目的目录；参见 "
"B<updatedb>(1)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:63
msgid ""
"If B<locate>'s output is going to a terminal, unusual characters in the "
"output are escaped in the same way as for the -print action of the "
"B<find> command.  If the output is not going to a terminal, file names "
"are printed exactly as-is."
msgstr ""
"如果 B<locate> 的输出要发送到终端，输出中的异常字符会按照 B<find> 命令 -print "
"操作的相同方式进行转义。如果输出不发送到终端，文件名将完全按原样打印。"

#. type: SH
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "选项"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-0, --null>"
msgstr "I<-0, --null>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:68
msgid "Use ASCII NUL as a separator, instead of newline."
msgstr "使用 ASCII NUL 而不是换行符作为分隔符。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-A, --all>"
msgstr "I<-A, --all>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:72
msgid ""
"Print only names which match all non-option arguments, not those matching"
" one or more non-option arguments."
msgstr "仅打印匹配所有非选项参数（而不是匹配一个或多个非选项参数）的名称。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-b, --basename>"
msgstr "I<-b, --basename>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:77
msgid ""
"Results are considered to match if the pattern specified matches the "
"final component of the name of a file as listed in the database.  This "
"final component is usually referred to as the `base name'."
msgstr "如果指定的模式与数据库中列出的文件名的最后一部分匹配，则认为结果匹配。最后一部分通常称为“基名”。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-c, --count>"
msgstr "I<-c, --count>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:81
msgid ""
"Instead of printing the matched filenames, just print the total number of"
" matches we found, unless --I<print> (-p) is also present."
msgstr "不打印匹配的文件名，而只打印找到的匹配总数，除非同时指定了 --I<print>（-p）。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-d path, --database=path>"
msgstr "I<-d path, --database=path>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:94
msgid ""
"Instead of searching the default file name database, search the file name"
" databases in I<path>, which is a colon-separated list of database file "
"names.  You can also use the environment variable B<LOCATE_PATH> to set "
"the list of database files to search.  The option overrides the "
"environment variable if both are used.  Empty elements in the path are "
"taken to be synonyms for the file name of the default database.  A "
"database can be supplied on stdin, using `-' as an element of I<path>. If"
" more than one element of I<path> is `-', later instances are ignored "
"(and a warning message is printed)."
msgstr ""
"不在默认文件名数据库中搜索，而是在 I<path> 指定的文件名数据库中搜索；I<path> 是以冒号分隔的数据库文件名列表。也可以使用环境变量 "
"B<LOCATE_PATH> "
"设置要搜索的数据库文件列表。如果同时使用两者，该选项会覆盖环境变量。路径中的空元素被视为默认数据库文件名的同义词。可以使用 `-' 作为 "
"I<path> 的元素，从标准输入提供数据库。如果 I<path> 中有多个元素为 `-'，后续实例会被忽略（并打印警告消息）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:111
msgid ""
"The file name database format changed starting with GNU B<find> and "
"B<locate> version 4.0 to allow machines with different byte orderings to "
"share the databases.  This version of B<locate> can automatically "
"recognize and read databases produced for older versions of GNU B<locate>"
" or Unix versions of B<locate> or B<find>.  Support for the old locate "
"database format will be discontinued in a future release."
msgstr ""
"从 GNU B<find> 和 B<locate> 4.0 版开始，文件名数据库格式发生了变化，以允许不同字节序的机器共享数据库。此版本的 "
"B<locate> 可以自动识别并读取旧版 GNU B<locate> 或 Unix 版 B<locate> 或 B<find> "
"生成的数据库。对旧 locate 数据库格式的支持将在未来版本中停止。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-e, --existing>"
msgstr "I<-e, --existing>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:120
msgid ""
"Only print out such names that currently exist (instead of such names "
"that existed when the database was created).  Note that this may slow "
"down the program a lot, if there are many matches in the database.  If "
"you are using this option within a program, please note that it is "
"possible for the file to be deleted after B<locate> has checked that it "
"exists, but before you use it."
msgstr ""
"仅打印当前存在的名称（而不是数据库创建时存在的名称）。请注意，如果数据库中有很多匹配项，这可能会显著降低程序速度。如果在程序中使用此选项，请注意文件可能在"
" B<locate> 检查其存在之后、你使用它之前被删除。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-E, --non-existing>"
msgstr "I<-E, --non-existing>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:126
msgid ""
"Only print out such names that currently do not exist (instead of such "
"names that existed when the database was created).  Note that this may "
"slow down the program a lot, if there are many matches in the database."
msgstr "仅打印当前不存在的名称（而不是数据库创建时存在的名称）。请注意，如果数据库中有很多匹配项，这可能会显著降低程序速度。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<--help>"
msgstr "I<--help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:131
msgid "Print a summary of the options to B<locate> and exit."
msgstr "打印 B<locate> 的选项摘要并退出。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-i, --ignore-case>"
msgstr "I<-i, --ignore-case>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:134
msgid "Ignore case distinctions in both the pattern and the file names."
msgstr "忽略模式和文件名中的大小写差异。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:134
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-l N, --limit=N>"
msgstr "I<-l N, --limit=N>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:139
msgid ""
"Limit the number of matches to N.  If a limit is set via this option, the"
" number of results printed for the -c option will never be larger than "
"this number."
msgstr "将匹配数限制为 N。如果通过此选项设置了限制，则 -c 选项打印的结果数永远不会大于此数量。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-L, --follow>"
msgstr "I<-L, --follow>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:143
msgid ""
"If testing for the existence of files (with the -e or -E options), "
"consider broken symbolic links to be non-existing.  This is the default."
msgstr "在测试文件是否存在时（使用 -e 或 -E 选项），将损坏的符号链接视为不存在。这是默认行为。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:143
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<--max-database-age D>"
msgstr "I<--max-database-age D>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:150
msgid ""
"Normally, B<locate> will issue a warning message when it searches a "
"database which is more than 8 days old.  This option changes that value "
"to something other than 8.  The effect of specifying a negative value is "
"undefined."
msgstr "通常，B<locate> 在搜索超过 8 天的数据库时会发出警告消息。此选项将该值改为 8 以外的值。指定负值的效果未定义。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:150
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-m, --mmap>"
msgstr "I<-m, --mmap>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:154 raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:183
msgid "Accepted but does nothing, for compatibility with BSD B<locate>."
msgstr "为兼容 BSD B<locate> 而接受，但不起任何作用。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:154
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-P, -H, --nofollow>"
msgstr "I<-P, -H, --nofollow>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:161
msgid ""
"If testing for the existence of files (with the -e or -E options), treat "
"broken symbolic links as if they were existing files.  The -H form of "
"this option is provided purely for similarity with B<find>; the use of -P"
" is recommended over -H."
msgstr ""
"在测试文件是否存在时（使用 -e 或 -E 选项），将损坏的符号链接视为已存在文件。-H 形式仅为与 B<find> 相似而提供；建议使用 -P "
"而不是 -H。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:161
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-p, --print>"
msgstr "I<-p, --print>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:165
msgid ""
"Print search results when they normally would not, because of the "
"presence of --statistics (-S) or --count (-c)."
msgstr "在由于存在 --statistics（-S）或 --count（-c）而通常不打印搜索结果时，仍然打印搜索结果。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:165
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-r, --regex >"
msgstr "I<-r, --regex >"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:179
msgid ""
"The pattern specified on the command line is understood to be a regular "
"expression, as opposed to a glob pattern.  The Regular expressions work "
"in the same was as in B<emacs> and B<find>, except for the fact that "
"\".\" will match a newline.  Filenames whose full paths match the "
"specified regular expression are printed (or, in the case of the -c "
"option, counted).  If you wish to anchor your regular expression at the "
"ends of the full path name, then as is usual with regular expressions, "
"you should use the characters ^ and $ to signify this."
msgstr ""
"命令行指定的模式被理解为正则表达式，而不是通配符模式。正则表达式的工作方式与 B<emacs> 和 B<find> 中相同，只是 \".\" "
"会匹配换行符。完整路径匹配指定正则表达式的文件名会被打印（对于 -c "
"选项则会被计数）。如果希望将正则表达式锚定在完整路径名的两端，则应像通常的正则表达式那样使用字符 ^ 和 $ 来表示。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:179
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-s, --stdio>"
msgstr "I<-s, --stdio>"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:183
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-S, --statistics>"
msgstr "I<-S, --statistics>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:192
msgid ""
"Print various statistics about each locate database and then exit without"
" performing a search, unless non-option arguments are given.  For "
"compatibility with BSD, -S is accepted as a synonym for --statistics.  "
"However, the output of B<locate -S> is different for the GNU and BSD "
"implementations of B<locate>."
msgstr ""
"打印每个 locate 数据库的各种统计信息，然后退出而不执行搜索，除非给出了非选项参数。为兼容 BSD，-S 可作为 --statistics "
"的同义词。然而，GNU 和 BSD 实现的 B<locate> 的 B<locate -S> 输出不同。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:192
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<--version>"
msgstr "I<--version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:197
msgid "Print the version number of B<locate> and exit."
msgstr "打印 B<locate> 的版本号并退出。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:197
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<-w, --wholename>"
msgstr "I<-w, --wholename>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:201
msgid ""
"Match against the whole name of the file as listed in the database.  This"
" is the default."
msgstr "针对数据库中列出的文件完整名称进行匹配。这是默认行为。"

#. type: SH
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:201
#, no-wrap
msgid "ENVIRONMENT"
msgstr "环境"

#. type: TP
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:202
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<LOCATE_PATH>"
msgstr "B<LOCATE_PATH>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:208
msgid ""
"Colon-separated list of databases to search.  If the value has a leading "
"or trailing colon, or has two colons in a row, you may get results that "
"vary between different versions of B<locate>."
msgstr "以冒号分隔的要搜索的数据库列表。如果值以冒号开头或结尾，或者连续出现两个冒号，不同版本的 B<locate> 可能会给出不同结果。"

#. type: SH
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:209
#, no-wrap
msgid "SEE ALSO"
msgstr "参见"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:212
msgid "B<find>(1), B<locatedb>(5), B<updatedb>(1), B<xargs>(1), B<glob>(3)"
msgstr "B<find>(1), B<locatedb>(5), B<updatedb>(1), B<xargs>(1), B<glob>(3)"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:222
msgid ""
"The full documentation for B<locate> is maintained as a Texinfo manual.  "
"If the B<info> and B<locate> programs are properly installed at your "
"site, the command B<info locate> should give you access to the complete "
"manual."
msgstr ""
"B<locate> 的完整文档以 Texinfo 手册形式维护。如果站点上正确安装了 B<info> 和 B<locate> 程序，命令 "
"B<info locate> 应能让你访问完整手册。"

#. type: SH
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:224
#, no-wrap
msgid "HISTORY"
msgstr "历史"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:244
msgid ""
"The B<locate> program started life as the BSD fast find program, "
"contributed to BSD by James A. Woods.  This was described by his paper "
"I<Finding Files Fast> which was published in Usenix I<;login:>, Vol 8, No"
" 1, February/March, 1983, pp. 8-10.  When the B<find> program began to "
"assume a default B<-print> action if no action was specified, this "
"changed the interpretation of B<find> B<pattern>.  The BSD developers "
"therefore moved the fast find functionality into B<locate>.  The GNU "
"implementation of B<locate> appears to be derived from the same code."
msgstr ""
"B<locate> 程序最初是 BSD fast find 程序，由 James A. Woods 贡献给 BSD。他的论文 I<Finding "
"Files Fast> 对此进行了描述，该论文发表于 Usenix I<;login:>，第 8 卷第 1 期，1983 年 2 月/3 月，第 "
"8-10 页。当 B<find> 程序开始在未指定操作时采用默认的 B<-print> 操作时，这改变了 B<find> B<pattern> "
"的解释。因此，BSD 开发者将 fast find 功能移入 B<locate>。GNU 版 B<locate> 似乎源自同一代码。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:248
msgid "Significant changes to B<locate> in reverse order:"
msgstr "B<locate> 的重要变更（按时间倒序）："

