msgid "BUGS"
msgstr "缺陷"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:275
msgid ""
"The locate database correctly handles filenames containing newlines, but "
"only if the system's sort command has a working -z option.  If you "
"suspect that B<locate> may need to return filenames containing newlines, "
"consider using its I<--null> option."
msgstr ""
"locate 数据库能够正确处理包含换行符的文件名，但前提是系统的 sort 命令具有可用的 -z 选项。如果你怀疑 B<locate> "
"可能需要返回包含换行符的文件名，请考虑使用其 I<--null> 选项。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/findutils/man1/locate.1:283
msgid ""
"The best way to report a bug is to use the form at "
"http://savannah.gnu.org/bugs/?group=findutils.  The reason for this is "
"that you will then be able to track progress in fixing the problem.  "
"Other comments about B<locate>(1) and about the findutils package in "
"general can be sent to the I<bug-findutils> mailing list.  To join the "
"list, send email to I<bug-findutils-request@gnu.org>."
msgstr ""
"报告缺陷的最佳方式是使用 http://savannah.gnu.org/bugs/?group=findutils "
"上的表单。这样你就可以跟踪问题修复进度。有关 B<locate>(1) 以及 findutils 软件包的其他评论，可以发送到 I<bug-"
"findutils> 邮件列表。要加入列表，请发送电子邮件至 I<bug-findutils-request@gnu.org>。"

